blocks.explanation:
Lead (seesa) ki density aur atomic number zyada hai, is liye yeh gamma rays ko bohat jazb karta hai. Detectors ke gird aur darmiyan lage lead collimators (shields aur patli deewarein, septa):
1. sirf un gamma rays ko detectors tak aane dete hain jo mareez se sahi simt mein aayein;
2. scatter hone wale photons aur field of view se bahar (maslan jism ke doosre hisson) se aane wali gamma rays ko jazb kar lete hain;
3. is tarah jhooti (random aur scattered) coincidences kam hoti hain, tasweer ka contrast aur saafi behtar hoti hai, aur detectors ki hifazat (shielding) bhi hoti hai.
